// YemiShell has NO login-time wallpaper spawn here.
//
// This file is dead config: Hyprland does not source ~/.config/quickshell/
// config.d/ (it uses ~/.config/hypr/modules/autostart.lua) and Niri uses its
// own ~/.config/niri/config.d/50-startup.kdl. It previously spawned
// boot-wallpaper-debug.sh, which shelled out to the retired `awww` binary and
// therefore only ever wrote empty diagnostic output. Removed along with the
// awww stack rather than left to mislead the next reader.
//
// Where wallpaper startup actually lives:
//   Hyprland : ~/.config/hypr/modules/autostart.lua
//              -> setsid set-wallpaper.sh hyprland init (waits for skwd helm)
//   Niri     : Walls.qml Component.onCompleted -> syncSkwd()

